### Get all lists
GET http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists

### Get one list
GET http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists/1

### Create a list
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "weekend",
  "overallPrice": 120.5,
  "userId": 1
}

### Create with a missing name (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "utility",
  "overallPrice": 10,
  "userId": 999
}

### Update a list
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekday",
  "overallPrice": 80
}

### Delete a list
DELETE http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglists/1

_________

### Invalid zip (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/food-waste/12

### Id is not a number (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglist/abc

### Create with missing name (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "overallPrice": 50,
  "userId": 1
}

### Create with negative price (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Negative",
  "overallPrice": -5,
  "userId": 1
}

### Update with blank name (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:8000/api/shoppinglist/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "overallPrice": 50
}